[Edition and access](https://wisdomexperience.org/product/long-discourses-buddha/).

Publisher, library, or owned edition. Copyrighted translation; no local copy is supplied.

The core reading here selects DN 2, 15, 16, 22, and 31. [Alternative translations and discourse descriptions](https://www.accesstoinsight.org/tipitaka/dn/index.html) identify their own translators and terms; they are not Walshe’s translation.

